   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IIDH - RBM capacity building</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">IIDH - RBM kapacitetsutveckling</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ge kapacitetsuppbyggnad i RBM-metoder och verktyg till IIDH genom soffa och in situ-verkstad i San Jose, Costa Rica. Verkstaden kommer att delta i andra lokala partners med huvudkontor i San Jose, Costa Rica.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provide capacity building in RBM methodologies and tools to IIDH through couching and in situ workshop in San Jose, Costa Rica. The workshop will be attended by other local partners headquartered in San Jose, Costa Rica.</narrative>
  </description>
